## What to deliver

Build the splitter sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief: one two-tile balancer spanning both 32×32
cells, its amber belt surface scrolling East across the eight frames in a seamless
loop, with the static grey-blue housing and central divider that mark it as a
balancer. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs are
your finished submission.
